Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=25}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.68,0:01:56.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.68,0:01:58.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}They wanna fight, too, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.39,0:02:01.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now this'll be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.81,0:02:04.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, Pops! You promised me, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.60,0:02:07.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I run those pirates off,\Nthen my debt to you is cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.82,0:02:08.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No more chores.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.78,0:02:09.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the deal...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.86,0:02:12.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no telling how\Nmuch more of my restaurant
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.53,0:02:14.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you could screw up if you stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.74,0:02:16.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.74,0:02:20.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, kid, you said you were going\Nto be King of the Pirates...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.04,0:02:21.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Were you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.54,0:02:26.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we can capture that ship, the Grand\NLine will be ours for the taking!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.83,0:02:28.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No more pretending to be Marines...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.92,0:02:31.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or raising the white flag of surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.84,0:02:37.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,None of our enemies will suspect that\Nwe're a threat with a ship like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.14,0:02:40.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In that boat, it'll\Nalways be a sneak attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.56,0:02:42.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's right. That boat\Nwould come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:47.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No one would think that pirates were\Non such a ridiculous-looking ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:48.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right, but Don...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.44,0:02:51.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even if we enter the Grand Line\Nagain using that vessel...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.69,0:02:53.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What if we come across someone\Nlike Hawk-Eye Mihawk again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.99,0:02:56.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then what'll we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.83,0:03:03.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate the input,\NSailor, anything else? Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.66,0:03:05.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,N... No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:09.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you think an ordinary man could\Ncut up a sailing ship like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.46,0:03:13.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That man probably has\Nthe power of the devil fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.97,0:03:18.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Although those with devil fruit\Npowers are rare and legendary to us...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.01,0:03:21.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I assure you they're\Ncommonplace on the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.89,0:03:26.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Mihawk must've used some sort of strange\Npower when he sliced our ship to ribbons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.94,0:03:30.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When we're on the Grand Line,\Nthose powers won't be special.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.61,0:03:33.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even the straw hat freak\Nwill be considered normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.24,0:03:40.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1910)}That old geezer, Red Foot Zeff,\Nsailed those seas for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:46.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}It stands to reason that he had\Nstrategies for dealing with those monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:51.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The techniques for surviving\Nthat parade of weirdos
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.34,0:03:57.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}must be written in the old man's logbook...\Nalong with clues to the One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.47,0:03:59.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see... You're a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.84,0:04:02.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is get\Nthat logbook and the ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.47,0:04:05.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then we'll be able to find our\Nway to the One Piece again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.31,0:04:06.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ya hear that, boys?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.81,0:04:09.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now let's get to it!\NThat restaurant will be ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.15,0:04:15.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You pirate scum are gonna\Nhafta get through us first!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.15,0:04:17.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go to the control room,\Nand open up the fins.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.78,0:04:21.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! No! That's a bad idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:23.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we do that, we'll be\Ngiving the enemy a foothold!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.66,0:04:26.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And that's just fine.\NWe gotta do whatever it takes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:28.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to keep those guys out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.50,0:04:32.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If they destroy the inside, then\Nthe old man'll complain forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.25,0:04:34.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you just say something, you brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.38,0:04:36.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah... I said you're whiney!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.59,0:04:37.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.13,0:04:38.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.22,0:04:43.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right... Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:46.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm comin' for ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.77,0:04:49.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum... Rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.77,0:04:51.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's flying over this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.77,0:04:53.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}And Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.77,0:05:00.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(1130,1130,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)\t(1149,1483,\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}... Giant Scythe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:09.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Didja see that?! Go, Kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.54,0:05:11.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the heck's\Nup with that guy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.46,0:05:12.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! He's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.71,0:05:14.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.29,0:05:17.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line is crawling\Nwith guys like these?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:19.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.63,0:05:22.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pay special attention\Nto how this one fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.05,0:05:23.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So Let me get this straight...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.68,0:05:26.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're attacking the\Nrestaurant that gave you food?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.18,0:05:29.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I got no choice but to beat\Nsome manners into you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.02,0:05:34.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you wanna fight on the water\Nwhere there's no place to stand, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.81,0:05:36.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A bold move for someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.98,0:05:41.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The devil fruit has taken your ability\Nto swim, hasn't it... Chore Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.53,0:05:43.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but now... I'm stretchy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.83,0:05:49.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji... Here come the fins!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.47,0:06:03.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.80,0:06:07.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now we have\Nsomewhere to fight 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.98,0:06:21.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa! That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:28.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My cooks and I will never give\Nup defending this place...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.62,0:06:29.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Prepare to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.62,0:06:30.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.87,0:06:34.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good plan, bringing up all\Nthat extra decking, genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.83,0:06:37.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now we don't have to\Ntake the fight inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.63,0:06:39.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd hate to damage my future ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.96,0:06:43.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And make no mistake, it will be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.22,0:06:46.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We will never let\Nyou have the restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.05,0:06:48.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right! We mean business!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.35,0:06:49.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're battle cooks now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.15,0:07:02.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Set sail, {\i1}Mackerel Head One{\i0},\Nthe Baratie's secret weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.86,0:07:06.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So If you wanna live,\NI'd suggest running away now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.66,0:07:11.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:14.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That thing is so... cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:15.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Paddle faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.58,0:07:16.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You paddle faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.71,0:07:20.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.47,0:07:26.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those guys\Nare gonna sink me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.93,0:07:28.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.68,0:07:30.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.14,0:07:33.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get 'em, guys! Get 'em!\NBlow 'em away! You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.02,0:07:37.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.11,0:07:40.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes on the prize, Patty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.90,0:07:42.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This one counts!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.07,0:07:46.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right! Krieg! Say your prayers!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.78,0:07:49.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Little did you know that\Nthe Sea Restaurant Baratie
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.62,0:07:52.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,had such a powerful weapon\Njust waiting to be unleashed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.46,0:08:04.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What happened?!\NDid we bump into something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.59,0:08:05.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're not moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.01,0:08:09.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am Don Krieg...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.93,0:08:12.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... the man who will rule... the oceans!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.47,0:08:14.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh no, you're not... I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.43,0:08:17.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for\Nthese stupid games!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.60,0:08:18.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.61,0:08:25.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way! He's so strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.03,0:08:35.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's coming straight for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.04,0:08:38.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The restaurant...! Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:56.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.47,0:08:58.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.45,0:09:12.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's got legs of steel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.57,0:09:15.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He kicked back that crazy boat\Njust like it was nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.95,0:09:17.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.75,0:09:19.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nice kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:24.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.75,0:09:26.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to crush your friends?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:27.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.71,0:09:30.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't "yeah, yeah" us, you crazy fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.63,0:09:32.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop acting so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.13,0:09:35.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't be so smug if we'd\Nbeen killed, you bucket of backwash!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.55,0:09:39.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, ladies, you think\Nyou could wrap this up another time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.60,0:09:41.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have business to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.48,0:09:42.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.20,0:09:52.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys still don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.24,0:09:55.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even well armed,\Nyou're still just cooks,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.03,0:09:57.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and we're expert fighters that\Nare {\i1}way{\i0} out of your league.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.41,0:10:01.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So why don't you be good little cooks,\Nand run along to a safer restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.16,0:10:02.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe one on land, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.37,0:10:06.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon, guys, why are you lettin'\N'em beat you up so easily, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:09.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you still call\Nyourselves fighting cooks?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.13,0:10:10.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, these pirates are really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.92,0:10:13.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're totally different from\Nthe ones we've fought before!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:16.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's insulting to lump us in\Nwith that average riffraff...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:18.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We are the great Krieg Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.60,0:10:21.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And we're the absolute\Nrulers of the East Blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.23,0:10:25.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let it be known to all... that\Nthis garish boat already belongs...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.15,0:10:27.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... to the great and\Npowerful Krieg Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.31,0:10:29.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know what,\NI've been a cook all my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.90,0:10:31.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've worked at a lot of restaurants,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.24,0:10:34.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and gotten fired from them all\Nfor scuffling and livin' hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.91,0:10:38.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And after years of wandering,\Nwe finally found a home here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.20,0:10:41.91,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Anybody here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.91,0:10:45.54,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the restaurant that's owned\Nby a guy name Red Foot Zeff, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:48.38,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! We found this "Damn Cooks\NWanted" sign, is it true?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:53.26,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah... It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.68,0:10:59.72,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,But you need to understand that\Nthis is no ordinary restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.72,0:11:03.18,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It really doesn't matter who they\Nare... or where they come from...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.18,0:11:07.65,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,... if someone comes in hungry...\Nwe will feed them until they're stuffed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.65,0:11:11.44,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Do I make myself clear?!\NCan you handle that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:13.03,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:21.74,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't serve anyone slop like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:23.75,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! What'd you go\Nand hit me for, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.75,0:11:25.71,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Share victory! Share defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.75,0:11:30.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We like fighting and cooking,\Nso this place is perfect for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.25,0:11:33.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right! There's\Nno other place like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:37.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You hear that? Now that's\Ntrue fighting spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.18,0:11:40.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Committing ourselves\Nto cooking fine cuisine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.10,0:11:42.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,day in and day out\Nis a fierce battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:46.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Compared to that,\Nthese pirates are nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.14,0:11:47.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's right. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.60,0:11:48.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.65,0:11:50.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Yeah!\N– Protect Zeff!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.48,0:11:51.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Protect the restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:05.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? The hell was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.29,0:12:09.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.92,0:12:16.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just what do you\Nguys think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.84,0:12:19.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who's that? Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.89,0:12:24.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So... let's do this...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.06,0:12:25.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... before we begin...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.77,0:12:27.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's only fair I give you a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:30.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am Pearl, the Invincible Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:32.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Pearl!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.19,0:12:35.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Patty! Carne! Are you boys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.15,0:12:37.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd say that pair is far from okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.36,0:12:39.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those two just experienced\Nmy Pearl Surprise,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.45,0:12:42.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,one of my signature punches,\Nyou bumbling, pathetic idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:46.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Look at that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.45,0:12:48.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nice knife... I think I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.62,0:12:52.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wha? Give it here... C'mon, let it go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.38,0:12:54.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I said, give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.00,0:12:54.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.52,0:13:09.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That guy knows how to\Nkick some serious butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:11.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A kitchen knife is a cook's soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.06,0:13:15.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}How dare you filthy pirates try to desecrate\None with your grubby little hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.69,0:13:17.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.36,0:13:19.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just stay down and hang on to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.11,0:13:22.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna teach these bozos a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:23.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must be out of your mind
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.87,0:13:26.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if you think we're gonna\Nbe beaten by a mere cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.13,0:13:38.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll show you "mere cook" after\NI fillet every one of you bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.26,0:13:42.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Hah! How very impudent of you\Nto defeat them all using only your kicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:45.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Am I to be impressed by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.10,0:13:47.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a cook, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:50.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I couldn't do my job very well\Nif I ruined my hands in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.52,0:13:53.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So I'll be taking you\Ndown with my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.06,0:13:55.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that so? I think not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.61,0:13:57.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm invincible, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.27,0:14:01.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've won all sixty-one of my battles\Ncompletely and totally unscathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.61,0:14:02.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's quite remarkable, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.78,0:14:06.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No one has ever shed a single\Ndrop of my blood in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.45,0:14:07.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.54,0:14:10.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now do you realize my power?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.04,0:14:16.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I may be a gentleman,\Nbut I'm not gentle...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.42,0:14:17.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.84,0:14:19.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Was that supposed to be a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.67,0:14:21.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Cause it wasn't even\Na little bit funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.47,0:14:25.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dropping your guard is a good\Nway to end up dead, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.81,0:14:34.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even battleship\Ncannons don't work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.81,0:14:37.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I come out of any attack unharmed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:42.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Boy, that could've been really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.28,0:14:44.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good thing I didn't\Nfall into the ocean...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.91,0:14:49.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,H... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.28,0:14:51.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't good...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:52.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Blood?! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.46,0:14:54.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pearl, don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.79,0:14:56.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's only a nosebleed, Pearl!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:58.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look, we know it's not a battle wound!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.96,0:15:00.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So just keep calm, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.75,0:15:01.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.76,0:15:05.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These people aren't just\Nmean; they're dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.01,0:15:07.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So... Uh... Wanna tell me\Nwhy everyone's freakin' out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.76,0:15:09.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're worried about a nosebleed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.35,0:15:14.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.48,0:15:17.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's just a nosebleed!\NDon't lose your cool! Relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.57,0:15:22.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geez... What is that guy doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.69,0:15:28.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Danger...! Danger...! Danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.54,0:15:33.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh no! It's started!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.83,0:15:36.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When he gets upset, he catches fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.71,0:15:38.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.63,0:15:46.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Fire Pearls... Special... Treat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.93,0:15:54.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Perish in my flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.64,0:15:58.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With my shields and this\Ninferno, I am invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.65,0:16:01.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.65,0:16:04.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need that ship, and\Nhe's gonna destroy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.69,0:16:07.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Ow! My butt's on fire!\N– Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.15,0:16:09.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! We're\Neither gonna burn or drown!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.78,0:16:11.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's destroying our only ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.49,0:16:12.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.62,0:16:14.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The restaurant's gonna catch fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:16.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not on my watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.46,0:16:17.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:18.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.62,0:16:22.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait! No! You'll get burned!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.75,0:16:25.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm\Ngonna let you torch our dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.39,0:16:32.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That guy's either brave or dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.93,0:16:35.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That cook is gonna burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.27,0:16:38.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... but... these\Nflames scare everyone away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.65,0:16:44.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well... if I was scared of fire...\NI wouldn't be much of a cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.15,0:16:46.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hate him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.53,0:16:48.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hate that refined gentleman!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.45,0:16:56.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa! He got him good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.29,0:16:58.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he just broke through\NPearl's invincible wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.71,0:17:05.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You stupid cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.38,0:17:07.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're totally insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.26,0:17:10.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll... kill... you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.84,0:17:13.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fire! Need more fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.05,0:17:14.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fire Pearls!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.89,0:17:18.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}No! The whole boat's gonna burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.23,0:17:21.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If the blaze gets\Nto the kitchen, the ship will explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.73,0:17:23.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run, Zeff! Get outta there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.61,0:17:24.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.03,0:17:37.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.29,0:17:39.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He put out my Fire Pearls?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.00,0:17:41.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fire Pearls, eh? That's kid's stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.50,0:17:44.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow! The gust from his kick\Nput out all of those flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.46,0:17:46.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Impossible! I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.71,0:17:49.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Red Foot Zeff is still\Njust as strong as ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.42,0:17:52.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Pops! I'm impressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.34,0:17:54.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So then, it's finally\Ncome down to this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.89,0:17:58.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've got no choice... Smash\Nthe fins or the boat burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.73,0:18:04.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.52,0:18:08.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He can't escape!\NHe's surrounded by fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.19,0:18:12.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ouchie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.28,0:18:13.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The chore boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.53,0:18:16.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum... Bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.99,0:18:18.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.87,0:18:20.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Ow! Hot! Hot! Hot!\N– He tossed that thing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.37,0:18:23.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Ow! Fire! Hot! Ow! Ah!\N– right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.85,0:18:40.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pearl is down! And he's not\Ngonna get up this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.85,0:18:42.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! Pearl!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.81,0:18:44.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.06,0:18:46.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that guy sure is goofy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:48.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You want\Nsomething done right...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.19,0:18:51.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... you got no choice\Nbut to do it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:18:59.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The battle ends right here...
Comment: 0,0:00:02.65,0:00:02.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=26}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=57}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
